flowchart TD
    Client[Client Write] --> Coord[Coordinator / Storage Node]

    subgraph Durability["1. Sequential Append (Disk)"]
        WAL[(Commit Log / WAL)]
    end

    subgraph Memory["2. In-Memory Buffer (RAM)"]
        Mem[Active Memtable<br/>Sorted Structure]
        Imm[Immutable Memtable]
    end

    subgraph Disk["3. Immutable SSTables & Compaction (Disk)"]
        L0[Level 0 SSTables<br/>Overlapping Key Ranges]
        Comp[Background Compaction<br/>Merge-Sort, Deduplicate, Drop Tombstones]
        L1[Level 1 SSTables<br/>Non-Overlapping Sorted Runs]
        L2[Level 2+ SSTables<br/>Larger Sorted Runs]
    end

    Coord -->|1a. Append for crash recovery| WAL
    Coord -->|1b. Insert sorted key-value| Mem
    Mem -.->|Ack once WAL + Memtable succeed| Client

    Mem -->|2. Size threshold reached| Imm
    Imm -->|3. Sequential flush| L0
    WAL -.->|Truncate flushed segment| L0

    L0 -->|4. Trigger compaction| Comp
    Comp -->|5. Write merged runs| L1
    L1 -->|6. Promote & compact| L2
